{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51713","headline":"酒令（涓与王司空锴等小酌，巡故字令。锴举一字三呼，两物相似。锴令曰：） 二 · 冯涓","name":"酒令（涓与王司空锴等小酌，巡故字令。锴举一字三呼，两物相似。锴令曰：） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巳巳巳，驴粪似马屎。\n（以上《监诫录》四《轻薄监》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯涓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}